2 polymer     man 'C-C motif chemokine 5'                            8662.117  1  ? ?                           ? 
;Sequence before CC motif
"QGPPLMALQS" (where the first residue Q is PCA as glutamine is cyclized into pyroglutamic acid residue) is artificial to replace native sequence "SPYSSDTTP".  As the register 0 for PCA, all the rest of residue numbers are consistent for chemokine residues.
